WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.866
Variatsiya usuli uchun ikkita bir jinsli yechim kerak.

2
00:00:03.866 --> 00:00:08.162
O‘zgaruvchan koeffitsiyentli tenglamada ularni topish qiyin.

3
00:00:08.162 --> 00:00:13.031
Ammo bittasi ma’lum bo‘lsa, ikkinchisini formula bilan olish mumkin.

4
00:00:13.031 --> 00:00:18.974
Buning kaliti Ostrogradskiy va Liuvill formulasi, uni Abel formulasi ham deyishadi.

5
00:00:19.224 --> 00:00:28.010
Vronskianni differensiallaymiz: W shtrix teng y bir y ikki ikki shtrix minus y bir ikki shtrix y ikki.

6
00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:34.901
Tenglamadan ikkinchi hosilalarni qo‘ysak, W shtrix teng minus p marta W chiqadi.

7
00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:42.998
Bu birinchi tartibli chiziqli tenglama, yechimi: W teng W nol marta e daraja minus integral p.

8
00:00:43.248 --> 00:00:50.694
Muhim natija: bitta tenglamaning yechimlari uchun Vronskian yo aynan nol, yo hech qayerda nol emas.

9
00:00:50.694 --> 00:00:58.741
Lekin ixtiyoriy funksiyalar uchun bu to‘g‘ri emas: iks kvadrat va iks marta iks moduli uchun Vronskian nol,

10
00:00:58.741 --> 00:01:00.622
ammo ular chiziqli erkli.

11
00:01:00.622 --> 00:01:04.382
Ular bunday tenglamaning yechimlari bo‘la olmaydi.

12
00:01:04.632 --> 00:01:14.753
Ikkinchi yechim formulasi: y ikki teng y bir marta integral e daraja minus integral p bo‘lingan y bir kvadrat.

13
00:01:14.753 --> 00:01:23.126
Misol: iks kvadrat y ikki shtrix minus uch iks y shtrix plyus to‘rt y teng nol, iks musbat,

14
00:01:23.126 --> 00:01:25.886
y bir teng iks kvadrat ma’lum.

15
00:01:26.136 --> 00:01:33.025
Avval normallashtiramiz: iks kvadratga bo‘lsak, p teng minus uch bo‘lingan iks.

16
00:01:33.025 --> 00:01:38.345
Minus integral p teng uch logarifm iks, eksponentasi iks kub.

17
00:01:38.345 --> 00:01:45.408
Integral ostida iks kub bo‘lingan iks to‘rtinchi daraja, ya’ni bir bo‘lingan iks.

18
00:01:45.408 --> 00:01:47.414
Integrali logarifm iks.

19
00:01:47.664 --> 00:01:51.114
Demak y ikki teng iks kvadrat logarifm iks,

20
00:01:51.114 --> 00:01:56.730
umumiy yechim C bir iks kvadrat plyus C ikki iks kvadrat logarifm iks.

21
00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:00.340
Tekshirish: y ikki ning hosilalarini qo‘ysak,

22
00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:06.758
iks kvadrat logarifm iks hadlari va qolgan hadlar alohida qisqarib, nol chiqadi.

23
00:02:07.008 --> 00:02:11.362
Grafikda ikki yechim: iks kvadrat va iks kvadrat logarifm iks.

24
00:02:11.362 --> 00:02:17.543
Iks birga teng nuqtada ikkinchisi nolga teng, lekin ular hech qayerda proporsional emas.

25
00:02:17.543 --> 00:02:24.566
Ularning Vronskiani iks kub, iks musbat bo‘lganda noldan farqli, bu Abel formulasi bilan mos keladi.

26
00:02:24.816 --> 00:02:35.425
Savol: iks y ikki shtrix plyus y shtrix plyus iks y teng nol tenglamaning ikki yechimi uchun Vronskian birda uchga teng.

27
00:02:35.425 --> 00:02:37.282
Ikkida u nimaga teng?

28
00:02:37.282 --> 00:02:40.288
Avval normallashtirishni unutmang.

29
00:02:40.288 --> 00:02:43.382
Videoni to‘xtatib, javobni tanlang.
